      "description": {
        "fun": "The violet robot lizard on the box of Pokémon Violet, and your ride across Paldea: it rolls on glowing wheel-like rings like a motorbike, floats on water and glides on an energy membrane. An old expedition journal calls it the Iron Serpent. Despite its machine look it eats sandwiches to get its strength back, and it sizes up a person's character before deciding to travel with them.",
        "guide": "An Electric and Dragon-type Legendary Paradox Pokémon and the mascot of Pokémon Violet, said to be either a descendant of Cyclizar or a version of it from a parallel timeline. It changes shape to drive, swim and glide, and battles in its Ultimate Mode. Its ancient counterpart is Koraidon.",
